{"topic": "Gradient Descent and Learning Rate", "audience": "", "brief": {"objective": "学生能复述本页核心结论", "keyClaim": "下山比喻：每一步沿最陡方向走一小步", "misconception": "", "visualTask": "视觉直接编码本页核心关系", "evidencePolicy": "none"}, "scene": {"id": "downhill-analogy", "kind": "content", "eyebrow": "直觉入门", "headline": "下山比喻：每一步沿最陡方向走一小步", "lead": "梯度是函数增长最快的方向，负梯度就是下降最快的方向。", "notes": "用二维等高线图展示梯度下降路径，让学生直观理解负梯度方向与步长的作用。", "blocks": [{"type": "list", "items": [{"lead": "方向", "text": "站在山坡上，**最陡的下坡方向**就是负梯度方向——函数下降最快的方向。", "icon": "trending-down"}, {"lead": "步长", "text": "每一步迈多大由*学习率*控制：步子太小走得慢，步子太大可能跳过最低点。", "icon": "book-open"}, {"lead": "迭代", "text": "每走一步就重新判断最陡方向，再迈下一步，直到脚下足够平坦——这就是梯度下降的迭代过程。", "icon": "trending-down"}], "id": "b1"}, {"type": "sim", "engine": "widget", "html": "<style>
  .lab { background: var(--bg2); border-radius: var(--radius, 12px); padding: 16px; color: var(--ink); height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .lab canvas { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 680px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; background: var(--card); border-radius: var(--radius, 8px); cursor: crosshair; flex: 1; }
  .controls { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .controls label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text2); white-space: nowrap; }
  .controls input[type=range] { flex: 1; min-width: 80px; accent-color: var(--accent); }
  .val { font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent); min-width: 40px; text-align: right; }
  .btn { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink); padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius, 6px); font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; transition: background 150ms, border-color 150ms; }
  .btn:hover { background: var(--bg2); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .btn:active { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); }
  .readout { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text2); }
  .readout .mono { color: var(--ink); }
</style>
<div class="lab">
  <canvas id="stage" width="680" height="360"></canvas>
  <div class="controls">
    <label for="lr">学习率</label>
    <input type="range" id="lr" min="0.01" max="0.5" step="0.01" value="0.1">
    <span class="val mono" id="lrVal">0.10</span>
    <button class="btn" id="stepForward">下一步</button>
    <button class="btn" id="reset">重置</button>
  </div>
  <div class="readout">
    <span>起点: (<span class="mono" id="startReadX">-1.50</span>, <span class="mono" id="startReadY">1.00</span>)</span>
    <span>步数: <span class="mono" id="stepRead">5</span></span>
    <span>当前位置: (<span class="mono" id="posReadX">—</span>, <span class="mono" id="posReadY">—</span>)</span>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  (function() {
    const root = document.documentElement;
    const tok = n => getComputedStyle(root).getPropertyValue(n).trim();
    const canvas = document.getElementById('stage');
    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
    const W = 680, H = 360;

    // state
    let startX = -1.5, startY = 1.0;
    let learningRate = 0.1;
    let currentStep = 5;
    let pathPoints = [];

    // DOM refs
    const lrInput = document.getElementById('lr');
    const lrVal = document.getElementById('lrVal');
    const stepBtn = document.getElementById('stepForward');
    const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');
    const startReadX = document.getElementById('startReadX');
    const startReadY = document.getElementById('startReadY');
    const stepRead = document.getElementById('stepRead');
    const posReadX = document.getElementById('posReadX');
    const posReadY = document.getElementById('posReadY');

    // loss function: f(x,y) = x^2 + 0.5*y^2 + 0.3*sin(2x)*cos(1.5y)
    function loss(x, y) {
      return x*x + 0.5*y*y + 0.3*Math.sin(2*x)*Math.cos(1.5*y);
    }

    // gradient of loss
    function grad(x, y) {
      const dx = 2*x + 0.6*Math.cos(2*x)*Math.cos(1.5*y);
      const dy = y - 0.45*Math.sin(2*x)*Math.sin(1.5*y);
      return { dx, dy };
    }

    // map data coords to canvas
    function toCanvas(x, y) {
      const px = (x + 2.5) / 5 * W;
      const py = (2.5 - y) / 5 * H;
      return { px, py };
    }

    // compute path from start
    function computePath() {
      const pts = [{ x: startX, y: startY }];
      let cx = startX, cy = startY;
      for (let i = 0; i < currentStep; i++) {
        const g = grad(cx, cy);
        const nx = cx - learningRate * g.dx;
        const ny = cy - learningRate * g.dy;
        // clamp to view
        if (nx < -2.5 || nx > 2.5 || ny < -2.5 || ny > 2.5) break;
        cx = nx; cy = ny;
        pts.push({ x: cx, y: cy });
      }
      return pts;
    }

    function draw() {
      const ink = tok('--ink');
      const accent = tok('--accent');
      const line = tok('--line');
      const mute = tok('--text2');
      const bg = tok('--bg');
      const card = tok('--card');

      ctx.clearRect(0, 0, W, H);

      // --- contour background ---
      const levels = 12;
      const minL = loss(-2.5, -2.5), maxL = loss(2.5, 2.5);
      const stepL = (maxL - minL) / levels;

      // draw filled contours
      for (let l = 0; l < levels; l++) {
        const thresh = minL + l * stepL;
        ctx.beginPath();
        let started = false;
        const res = 40;
        for (let i = 0; i <= res; i++) {
          for (let j = 0; j <= res; j++) {
            const x = -2.5 + (5 * i) / res;
            const y = -2.5 + (5 * j) / res;
            const v = loss(x, y);
            if (v <= thresh) {
              const { px, py } = toCanvas(x, y);
              if (!started) { ctx.moveTo(px, py); started = true; }
              else ctx.lineTo(px, py);
            }
          }
        }
        const alpha = 0.08 + 0.06 * (l / levels);
        ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(128,128,128,${alpha})`;
        ctx.fill();
      }

      // contour lines
      ctx.strokeStyle = line;
      ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;
      for (let l = 1; l < levels; l++) {
        const thresh = minL + l * stepL;
        ctx.beginPath();
        const res = 60;
        for (let i = 0; i <= res; i++) {
          for (let j = 0; j <= res; j++) {
            const x = -2.5 + (5 * i) / res;
            const y = -2.5 + (5 * j) / res;
            const v = loss(x, y);
            if (Math.abs(v - thresh) < stepL * 0.3) {
              const { px, py } = toCanvas(x, y);
              ctx.lineTo(px, py);
            }
          }
        }
        ctx.stroke();
      }

      // --- path ---
      if (pathPoints.length > 0) {
        // path line
        ctx.strokeStyle = accent;
        ctx.lineWidth = 2;
        ctx.beginPath();
        for (let i = 0; i < pathPoints.length; i++) {
          const { px, py } = toCanvas(pathPoints[i].x, pathPoints[i].y);
          if (i === 0) ctx.moveTo(px, py);
          else ctx.lineTo(px, py);
        }
        ctx.stroke();

        // path dots
        for (let i = 0; i < pathPoints.length; i++) {
          const { px, py } = toCanvas(pathPoints[i].x, pathPoints[i].y);
          ctx.fillStyle = i === 0 ? mute : accent;
          ctx.beginPath();
          ctx.arc(px, py, i === 0 ? 6 : 3, 0, Math.PI * 2);
          ctx.fill();
        }

        // current point (last)
        const last = pathPoints[pathPoints.length - 1];
        const { px: lx, py: ly } = toCanvas(last.x, last.y);
        ctx.fillStyle = accent;
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.arc(lx, ly, 7, 0, Math.PI * 2);
        ctx.fill();

        // gradient arrow at current point
        const g = grad(last.x, last.y);
        const mag = Math.sqrt(g.dx * g.dx + g.dy * g.dy);
        if (mag > 0.001) {
          const scale = 30 / mag;
          const ex = lx - g.dx * scale;
          const ey = ly + g.dy * scale;
          ctx.strokeStyle = accent;
          ctx.lineWidth = 2;
          ctx.beginPath();
          ctx.moveTo(lx, ly);
          ctx.lineTo(ex, ey);
          ctx.stroke();
          // arrowhead
          const angle = Math.atan2(ey - ly, ex - lx);
          ctx.fillStyle = accent;
          ctx.beginPath();
          ctx.moveTo(ex, ey);
          ctx.lineTo(ex - 8 * Math.cos(angle - 0.4), ey - 8 * Math.sin(angle - 0.4));
          ctx.lineTo(ex - 8 * Math.cos(angle + 0.4), ey - 8 * Math.sin(angle + 0.4));
          ctx.closePath();
          ctx.fill();
        }

        // update readouts
        posReadX.textContent = last.x.toFixed(3);
        posReadY.textContent = last.y.toFixed(3);
      } else {
        posReadX.textContent = '—';
        posReadY.textContent = '—';
      }

      // start point marker
      const { px: sx, py: sy } = toCanvas(startX, startY);
      ctx.strokeStyle = mute;
      ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;
      ctx.setLineDash([4, 4]);
      ctx.beginPath();
      ctx.arc(sx, sy, 10, 0, Math.PI * 2);
      ctx.stroke();
      ctx.setLineDash([]);
      ctx.fillStyle = mute;
      ctx.beginPath();
      ctx.arc(sx, sy, 4, 0, Math.PI * 2);
      ctx.fill();

      // step count
      stepRead.textContent = currentStep;
    }

    function update() {
      pathPoints = computePath();
      draw();
    }

    // --- interactions ---
    canvas.addEventListener('mousedown', e => {
      const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
      const scaleX = W / rect.width;
      const scaleY = H / rect.height;
      const mx = (e.clientX - rect.left) * scaleX;
      const my = (e.clientY - rect.top) * scaleY;
      const x = (mx / W) * 5 - 2.5;
      const y = 2.5 - (my / H) * 5;
      if (x < -2.5 || x > 2.5 || y < -2.5 || y > 2.5) return;
      startX = Math.round(x * 100) / 100;
      startY = Math.round(y * 100) / 100;
      currentStep = 0;
      startReadX.textContent = startX.toFixed(2);
      startReadY.textContent = startY.toFixed(2);
      update();
    });

    lrInput.addEventListener('input', e => {
      learningRate = parseFloat(e.target.value);
      lrVal.textContent = learningRate.toFixed(2);
      currentStep = 0;
      update();
    });

    stepBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      currentStep = Math.min(currentStep + 1, 50);
      update();
    });

    resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      currentStep = 0;
      update();
    });

    // initial paint
    update();

    // theme change observer
    const obs = new MutationObserver(() => { draw(); });
    obs.observe(root, { attributes: true, attributeFilter: ['data-theme'] });
  })();
</script>", "spec": {"core_insight": "从不同起点出发，用不同学习率，梯度下降路径会不同，但最终都沿负梯度方向逼近最低点。", "render_medium": "canvas", "render_medium_reason": "需要连续绘制等高线、梯度箭头和动态路径点，canvas 更适合频繁重绘和动画效果。", "state_model": [{"name": "startX", "type": "float", "range": "-2..2", "init": "-1.5"}, {"name": "startY", "type": "float", "range": "-2..2", "init": "1.0"}, {"name": "learningRate", "type": "float", "range": "0.01..0.5", "init": "0.1"}, {"name": "currentStep", "type": "int", "range": "0..50", "init": "5"}, {"name": "pathPoints", "type": "array", "range": "", "init": "[]"}], "interactions": [{"trigger": "canvas mousedown", "effect": "更新 startX, startY 为点击坐标，重置 currentStep=0 和 pathPoints=[]，重绘等高线并开始下降路径"}, {"trigger": "range#learningRate input", "effect": "更新 learningRate，重置 currentStep=0 和 pathPoints=[]，立即重绘新路径"}, {"trigger": "button#stepForward click", "effect": "currentStep+=1，若未收敛则计算下一步坐标并追加到 pathPoints，重绘路径"}, {"trigger": "button#reset click", "effect": "重置 currentStep=0 和 pathPoints=[]，重绘初始状态"}], "update": "从当前 startX, startY 出发，用 learningRate 沿负梯度方向迭代 currentStep 步，生成 pathPoints 数组；然后清空 canvas，绘制等高线背景、路径点连线、当前点位置和梯度方向箭头。", "initial_paint": "等高线图已绘制，起点(startX=-1.5, startY=1.0)处有一个高亮圆点，从该点出发已走了5步（learningRate=0.1），路径点用连线和小圆点显示，当前点处有红色箭头指示下一步负梯度方向。"}, "id": "b2"}], "layout": {"kind": "split", "anchor": ["b1"], "ratio": 0.4}}, "referenceMaterial": "[none provided]"}

